
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Receptionist / Administrator
    participant UI as Patient Edit Page
    participant Auth as Authentication
    participant Action as Patient Update Action
    participant Repo as Patient Repository
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Staff->>UI: Open patient record
    UI->>Auth: Verify staff role
    alt Unauthorized
        Auth-->>Staff: Access denied
    else Authorized
        UI->>Repo: Retrieve patient details
        Repo->>DB: SELECT approved patient fields
        DB-->>Repo: Patient information
        Repo-->>UI: Return patient details
        UI-->>Staff: Display editing form
        Staff->>Action: Submit changes and CSRF token
        Action->>Auth: Verify staff role
        Action->>Action: Validate CSRF and inputs
        Action->>Repo: Update approved fields
        alt Invalid information
            Repo-->>Action: Validation error
            Action-->>Staff: Display error
        else Valid information
            Repo->>DB: Prepared UPDATE users
            DB-->>Repo: Update result
            Repo-->>Action: Success
            Action-->>Staff: Redirect with success message
        end
    end
    Note over Repo,DB: Sensitive medical data is not modified
